//// The `emilia` package — module-tree root.
////
//// `emilia` is a single-module library: `emilia.bp` carries the whole lib
//// (the `EmiliaClass` record, the `styled` namespace, the `css`/`tw` template
//// fns, and the `Stylesheet` host-cell seam). Declaring it `pub default mod`
//// makes it the package's public surface AND its default module: a consumer
//// reaches the named items via `import {styled, css, tw} from "emilia"` and
//// binds the package handle with `import emilia`, which resolves to the
//// module's `pub default fn` (the `tw "…"` utility template).
////
//// The runtime is intentionally absent from this seed commit — see
//// `tasks/v0.beta.19/specs/emilia.md` in the parent workspace for the intent
//// + the F-step ordering.

pub default mod emilia;
